{"id": "136316", "name": "חישוב דטרמיננטת מכפלה", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "(", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונות מטריצות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A,B\\in M_n(\\mathbb{C})\\)</span>. נסמן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\det(A)=a\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\det(B)=b\\)</span>.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>הביעו באמצעות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a,b\\)</span>:</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\det(A^2 B A^t B^t (AB)^{-1})=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">הערה: לפני שאתם מגישים את תשובתכם, ודאו שהמערכת לא זיהתה בתשובתכם משתנים פרט ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(b\\)</span>.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "det", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "corans", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "